  "description": "Boots a real nanoFramework deployment (nanoBooter + nanoCLR + your .pe assemblies) on the\n      RP2350Sharp cycle-accurate emulator and drives it to points of interest inside the running CLR:\n      run-until a native call, a managed method, or a static-field predicate, and read managed state\n      (static fields, arrays, instances) straight out of the emulated heap. The Cortex-M33 twin of\n      RP2040Sharp.NanoFramework.TestKit — same NfClr.Core API, so tests port by changing the using.",
